<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF offers 1.2 trln yen six-month T-bills.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF offers 1.2 trln yen six-month T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) said on Wednesday it was offering 1.2 trillion yen worth of six-month Treasury Bills through a price-competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be March 10 and the maturity date September 10.</p>
</text>
